  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Le7cALn.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Forge 1.13+ 使用 Forge 團隊的 <a href=\"https://github.com/MinecraftForge/CoreMods\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoreMods</a> 專案，取代 Sponge 團隊的 <a href=\"https://github.com/SpongePowered/Mixin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mixin</a> 專案。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Forge 1.12 採用 Sponge 團隊的 <a href=\"https://github.com/SpongePowered/Mixin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mixin</a> 專案，無需 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>。</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">若在 1.12 版本遇到任何當機問題，您可能需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixin-0-7-0-8-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinCompat</a>，或依照 <a href=\"https://github.com/LXGaming/MixinBootstrap/issues/38\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處說明</a> 重新命名 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>。<br><span style=\"color:#f00\">若您遇到 <span style=\"color:#808080\">褪色</span> 或 <span style=\"color:#000\">黑色</span> 文字，請於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast</a></strong> 中停用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShayBox/Durability101/issues/16\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">HUD Batching</span></strong></a>。</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>其他模組</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/durability-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow\">耐久度查看器 (LiteLoader 1.7.10-1.8.9)</a></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1285383-1-6-2-jul-13-durability101-hotbar-visible-use\" rel=\"nofollow\">Durability101 (Vanilla、ML 與 Forge 1.3.2-1.6.2)</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#f00;text-align:center\"><strong>可自由用於任何模組整合包！</strong></h2>",
